<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIAN INDOOR MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIAN INDOOR MEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third round results in the</p>
<p>Croatian indoor men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Alex Radulescu (Germany)</p>
<p>6-0 1-1 - retired</p>
<p>5-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Gaston Etlis (Argentina) 6-0</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>7-5 6-3</p>
<p>2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
